    "description": "Learn how to calculate photography business profit margin, owner pay, break-even bookings, and pricing with realistic US owner-operator examples.",
    "metaDescription": "Calculate photography business profit margin, owner pay, break-even bookings and pricing with realistic worked examples for US owner-operators.",
    "image": "/images/blog/day3-photography-margin.webp",
    "alt": "Photography business owner reviewing profit margin and operating costs",
