    "description": "Learn the restaurant profit margin average with gross versus net margin, owner take-home, break-even math, capacity, and US examples.",
    "metaDescription": "Learn the restaurant profit margin average using gross versus net margin, owner take-home, break-even math, capacity and realistic US examples.",
    "image": "/images/blog/day3-restaurant-margin.webp",
