    "title": "Agency Profit Margin and Utilization: A Practical Owner-Operator Guide",
    "seoTitle": "Agency Profit Margin and Utilization Guide",
    "description": "Learn how US owner-operators calculate agency profit margin, utilization, gross margin, take-home pay, and break-even revenue with real examples.",
